      "source_xml_line": 2612,
      "string_id": "dusty_dialog_3_phrase_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Tell me, why do you work for the Bartender?",
      "JA_current": "なあ、どうしてバーキープの下で働いてるんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "dusty_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:dusty_dialog_3_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2615,
      "string_id": "dusty_dialog_3_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It's all through my stupidity and inconsideration. I owed a debt to a local faction. The barkeep found out that I was a good craftsman and paid off my debts. In exchange, I work for him fixing weapons and armor, and the money goes into his pocket. That's the way it is.",
      "JA_current": "全部、俺の浅はかさと向こう見ずのせいさ。地元の勢力に借金を作っちまってな。バーキープが俺の腕を見込んで肩代わりしてくれたんだ。その代わり、ここで武器や防具を修理して、稼ぎはあいつの懐に入るってわけだ。そういう事情さ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "dusty_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:dusty_dialog_3_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2618,
      "string_id": "dusty_dialog_3_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "How'd you manage to get into debt?",
      "JA_current": "どうしてそんな借金を？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "dusty_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:dusty_dialog_3_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2621,
      "string_id": "dusty_dialog_3_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I volunteered to be a guide in a dangerous sweep operation. I didn't know the terrain very well, so I took my chances with sheer experience... Half the group died, and many of the survivors wanted me dead. But in the end it all worked out, as you can see. I learned a lifelong lesson: think first and act later.",
      "JA_current": "危険な掃討作戦の道案内を買って出たんだ。土地勘もねえくせに、過去の経験だけで何とかなると高をくくってな……部隊は半数が死に、生き残った連中は揃って俺の命を狙い始めた。まあ、見ての通り最後はどうにかなったがね。おかげで一生モノの教訓を得たよ。行動する前にまず頭を使え、ってな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "dusty_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:dusty_dialog_3_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2624,
      "string_id": "dusty_dialog_3_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I agree.",
      "JA_current": "全くだな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
